  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-lab art direction, crisp headline hierarchy, restrained cyan/red palette, and polished evidence cards. Desktop is well balanced, but tablet has excessive dead space and disconnected connector paths; mobile loses the diagram’s visual storytelling by reducing it to a plain card stack. The tablet/mobile headers also feel clipped and cryptic, with truncated navigation and extremely small, low-emphasis labels.",
